  foreground (ic_muslim_launcher_foreground_v2028.png).

  Design DNA (Modern Islamic Minimalism) — REVISED BOLD to match gold launcher at glance:
  • Hollow 8-point star = interlaced outer frame (two squares, 0° + 45°) rendered as a
    hollow outline (outer star + inner star evenOdd) so the fill matches the PNG's
    thick gold hollow frames but with a bolder 10-12 dp frame (inner scale 0.72) so
    the white silhouette reads as strongly as the gold at 24 dp status size and in
    the MediaStyle shade chip.
  • Central mihrab = hollow arch outline (outer arch + inner arch) enlarged + crescent
    enlarged to R14.5/R12 for better legibility at small notification size.
  • User-requested: recitation glyph must be visually identical to the official
    gold launcher — the bolder hollow + enlarged crescent achieves that while
    remaining single-colour for status-bar tint.

  Why bolder hollow vs thin: the previous 0.82 scale produced a ~2 dp faint outline
  that looked washed-out inside the light-blue "This phone" media chip; 0.72 gives
  ~3.2 dp and matches the gold's visual weight at glance.
-->
